  "body_excerpt": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">ASUS has released a Software Update for Armoury Crate, a system management software. This update includes important security updates and ASUS strongly recommends that users update their Armoury Crate installation to &nbsp;V6.5.7.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The latest Software Update can be received by opening Armoury Crate, in the &ldquo;Settings&rdquo;&gt; &ldquo;Update Center&rdquo; tab, and clicking &ldquo;Check for Updates&rdquo;. Click &ldquo;Update&rdquo; on Armoury Crate if the new version is available.</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><a href=\"https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-8070\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CVE-2026-8070</a></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">CVSS 4.0 Score：7.3 / High</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">AV:L/AC:H/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N</span></div>\n</div>",
